        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"1012812\">Philipp Weisang</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113488-general/topic/Obtain.20existential.20witness.20in.20a.20definition/near/578647683\">ha dicho</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I can use any. The operation is independent of the choice of representative.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>If you're taking \"representatives\", presumably you want to be using <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Quotient#doc\">docs#Quotient</a> and <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Quotient.lift#doc\">docs#Quotient.lift</a></p>",
