<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">range</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">lq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">δ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">my_delta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">my_repr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">q₀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">δ_one</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">δ_mul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>voilà</p>\n<p>I tend to agree with Violeta that using <code>Quotient</code> is probably more idiomatic.</p>",
        "id": 578745570,
